# NEXA QA Assessment Rules

## Application scope

- **Toolshop (assessment SUT):** https://practicesoftwaretesting.com/ + https://api.practicesoftwaretesting.com/
- **NEXA (read-only):** https://www.nexaexperience.com/ — no lead/booking forms.
- **JSONPlaceholder:** dummy API only.

## Repository conventions

- Single Playwright project: `PrismStructure-playwright/`.
- Toolshop: `npm run test:toolshop` | NEXA: `npm run test:nexa`
- Page objects: `POManager` (NEXA), `ToolshopPOManager` (Toolshop) — separate files, same `ui/pageobjects/` folder.
- Manual cases: `FunctionalTestCase.csv` (NEXA), `ToolshopFunctionalTestCase.csv` (Toolshop).
- Execution evidence: copy HTML report to `execution-evidence/` after runs.
- AI prompt history: update `ai-prompts/` after each significant Cursor session.

## Automation standards

- Page Object Model via `POManager` / `ToolshopPOManager` and `ui/pageobjects/`.
- Selectors: `data-test` attributes on Toolshop; ARIA/href on NEXA.
- Tag tests: `@smoke` and `@regression` in spec titles.
- Assert structure on live site (presence, counts, URLs) — not exact dealer names or marketing copy.

## AI usage

- Record prompts and summaries in `ai-prompts/` (requirements, test-design, test-data, automation-and-debugging, documentation-and-summary).
- Validate AI-generated selectors against live DOM before committing.
- Do not paste secrets, API keys, or real personal data into prompts.

## Submission checklist

- `requirements-and-risk-analysis.md`, `project-info.md`, `readme.md` current.
- All automated tests pass; manual CSV statuses updated.
- `execution-evidence/` contains latest Playwright HTML report.
- Git: iterative commits; public repo URL for submission.
